DBA: the database (dbm-style) abstraction layer, with the cdb, inifile
and flatfile handlers.

The module dba of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20190902/dba.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d, its headers in
include/php74/php/ext/dba.
